SWEET Bluetooth: patch 0295 (bt/defaults 2026-11-11), the four boot-args every proven Bluetooth boot passed are ON by default: sweetbt, sweetbtkeepbaud, sweetbtpatchram, sweetbtlefeat (patches 0189/0215/0228/0274). Absent = on, =1 = on, =0 = off with one `BT GAP: <knob>=0: default-on knob switched off by boot-arg: <effect>` line per knob at attach, any other value = on plus a BT GAP. One helper sbu_knob_default_on() replaces the five PE_parse_boot_argn(...) && v == 1 reads. Every diagnostic BT knob (sweetbtrfwit, sweetbtromread, sweetbtvsc, sweetbtnopcf, sweetbtpubscan, ...) keeps its default. Companion in the same branch: tools/mkadt.py PIXOS_ADT_AUDIO default on. Applies after 0285.

